      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prudhoe_Bay%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1967, after several attempts at drilling for oil, oil company mergers, and competitive bidding for state lease sales, the Prudhoe Bay oil field was discovered.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
