    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The only legal way for non-workers to see Prudhoe Bay itself is through authorized guided tours arranged by approved operators.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://thetundradrums.com/is-prudhoe-bay-open-to-tourists/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During winter, the surface hardens enough to support heavy equipment, allowing new construction.",
