      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prudhoe_Bay%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Facilities are built entirely on man-made gravel pads and usually consist of pre-fabricated modules shipped to Deadhorse via barge or air cargo.",
